MAIN
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 8
MOVE TEMP 16 HALLOCATE TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 A_fun
HSTORE TEMP 7 4 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 A_fun2
HSTORE TEMP 7 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 TEMP 7
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 6
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 5 0
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 8 4
MOVE TEMP 20 10
MOVE TEMP 21 CALL TEMP 9 ( TEMP 5 TEMP 20 )
PRINT TEMP 21
END
A_fun [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 0
MOVE TEMP 22 CALL TEMP 12 ( TEMP 10 TEMP 2 )

RETURN TEMP 22
END
A_fun2 [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 23 10
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 24 0
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 24
L0 MOVE TEMP 25 LE TEMP 4 TEMP 3
CJUMP TEMP 25 L1
MOVE TEMP 26 MINUS TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 27 PLUS TEMP 26 TEMP 3
PRINT TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 28 PLUS TEMP 2 TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 1
MOVE TEMP 30 PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 31 1
MOVE TEMP 32 MINUS TEMP 3 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 32
JUMP L0
L1  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 2
END

